category: Libs
build-depends: cygport gcc-fortran python3-numpy
sdesc: "General GTO integrals for quantum chemistry (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "libcint is an open source library for analytical Gaussian integrals.
It provides C/Fortran API to evaluate one-electron / two-electron
integrals for Cartesian / real-spheric / spinor Gaussian type functions."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/sunqm/libcint
license: BSD-2-Clause
